Macro: ifish
c: cl #R
v1: 0.1*(5 rsi #r) - 50
v2: (1|9) wtave v1
tanh v2

Macro: ifish (flexible RSI length)
c: cl #R
n: #l
v1: 0.1*(#l rsi #r) - 50
v2: (1|9) wtave v1
tanh v2

Macro: cycle
a: 0.07
n1: 1 - .5*a
n2: 1 - a
price: midrange #r
smooth: 1 2 2 1 wtave price
dsmooth: 1 -2 1 wtsum smooth
cycle: 1 -2 1 wtave price first 6
cycle: ((n1^2) * dsmooth) + (2*n2*cycle back 1) - ((n2^2)*cycle back 2)
cycle
